{"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"downgradeFromDPoP"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"_"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"user"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.salesforce.mobilesdk.SalesforceSDKCore\/documentation\/SalesforceSDKCore\/UserAccount","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)SFUserAccount","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"UserAccount"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"success"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"completionBlock"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"attribute","text":"@escaping "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.salesforce.mobilesdk.SalesforceSDKCore\/documentation\/SalesforceSDKCore\/AccountManagerSuccessCallbackBlock","preciseIdentifier":"c:SFUserAccountManager.h@T@SFUserAccountManagerSuccessCallbackBlock","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"AccountManagerSuccessCallbackBlock"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"failure"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"failureBlock"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"attribute","text":"@escaping "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.salesforce.mobilesdk.SalesforceSDKCore\/documentation\/SalesforceSDKCore\/AccountManagerFailureCallbackBlock","preciseIdentifier":"c:SFUserAccountManager.h@T@SFUserAccountManagerFailureCallbackBlock","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"AccountManagerFailureCallbackBlock"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"]}]},{"parameters":[{"name":"user","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The user account to downgrade from DPoP."}]}]},{"name":"completionBlock","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Called on successful dow